# Auth & supreme settings

- Login: email + password (Convex Auth). No public signup.
- Distinct blocking login errors: invalid credentials, `ACCOUNT_LOCKED`, `USER_NOT_ACTIVE`.
- `loginLockedAt` is enforced at sign-in and on authenticated calls (`currentUserOrThrow`).
- Forgot-password: send email **before** rotating credentials; per-user cooldown only (no IP rate limit).
- Profile `changeOwnPassword` requires `currentPassword`. Forced `mustChangePassword` gate only sends `newPassword`.
- Do not disable/delete/demote the last active admin (`LAST_ACTIVE_ADMIN`).
- Supreme settings UI/API: **admin only** (`adminPermissionOrThrow`)
- Catalog codes (PB / chức vụ / nhóm quyền): ≤20, `A–Z0–9_-`, uppercase; see `convex/entityCodes.ts`
- Soft-delete catalogs; refuse delete when users still assigned (`HAS_ASSIGNED_USERS`)
- Never log/commit plaintext passwords or auth secrets
- Bulk import rules: `.cursor/rules/bulk-user-import.mdc` and `README.md`
